sequenceDiagram
    title Executing a GovDAO proposal
    autonumber
    actor User
    participant D as r/gov/dao
    participant T as r/gov/treasury
    User->>D: Propose(cross, ...)
    D-->>User: proposal id
    Note over D: voting period<br/>7 days
    loop every vote
        User->>+D: Vote(cross, id, yes)
    end
    D->>T: Execute(cross)
    alt enough funds
        T-->>D: ok
    else not enough
        T--xD: panic
    end
    D->>D: emit ProposalExecuted
    Note right of T: funds<br/>moved
